	(descr "Bourns SMBJ-Q 600W unidirectional TVS, DO-214AA (SMB), 4.57 x 3.94 x 2.20mm, AEC-Q101, -55 to +150C TJ. Pin 1 = cathode, pin 2 = anode. Series land pattern - the standoff is set by the order number, e.g. SMBJ12A-Q for 12V standoff, 13.3V VBR min, 19.9V VC at 30.2A. Pads are oversized against the datasheet minima for heat sinking; the 5.0W steady-state rating assumes large copper at each terminal")
